OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain or
OL,6,Fshowers continuing this evening and
OL,7,Ftonight, with some more persistent
OL,8,Frain for Caithness. Some drier clearer
OL,9,Fspells developing across Easter Ross
OL,10,Fand the Inverness area overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA bright dry start in East
OL,13,FHighland otherwise rather cloudy with
OL,14,Fsome showers, one or two on the heavy
OL,15,Fside. Rather cool, freshening
OL,16,Fnortheasterly winds in far north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
